    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I rollback a transaction using an API request, in some cases a set of orphan records remains in the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "em"
        }
       ],
       "text": "search_resource_rdf_type_transactions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " table in the index. I have not yet been able to fully observe in which cases this happens more accurately.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
